# Glowbe web UI language

- All **user-visible** strings in the Glowbe web app (`projects/Glowbe/web/`) must be **English**: button labels, headings, descriptions, placeholders, `aria-label`, tooltips, empty states, and error messages shown in the UI.
- Prefer clear, concise UI copy. Avoid mixing languages in the same view.
